, Page 24", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": true, "exam": "TNPSC", "exam_name": "Group 4", "year": 2022, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["Class 11", "Unit 2", "Prose", "PYQ"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "11th_tamil_u2_q011", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "hard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "11", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_2", "lesson_id": "prose_iyarkai_velanmai", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "mulching_concept", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "வேளாண்மையில் ‘மூடாக்கு’ (Mulching) அமைப்பதன் முதன்மையான பயன் யாது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "மழை பெய்யாமல் தடுப்பது", "B": "பயிர்களின் வளர்ச்சியைத் தடுப்பது", "C": "மண்ணின் ஈரப்பதம் ஆவியாகாமல் காத்து, களைகள் முளைப்பதைத் தடுத்து, பின் மட்கி உரமாக மாறுவது", "D": "பூச்சிகள் தங்குவதற்கு இடம் கொடுப்பது"}, "explanation": "வைக்கோல், காய்ந்த இலைகளை நிலத்தில் பரப்புவதால் ஈரப்பதம் காக்கப்பட்டு, களைகள் கட்டுப்படுத்தப்பட்டு, நிலம் மண்புழுக்களின் புகலிடமாக மாறுகிறது."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "What is the foundational agroecological benefit of 'Mulching' (Moodaakku) with dry straw and leaves in natural farming?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Preventing rainfall from entering soil", "B": "Stunting crop height", "C": "Conserving soil moisture from evaporation, suppressing weed emergence, and decomposing into organic humus", "D": "Breeding harmful termites"}, "explanation": "Mulching retains moisture, stifles weeds, protects soil fauna, and enriches topsoil as decomposed humus."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "