{"id": "11th_tamil_u2_q075", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "hard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "11", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_2", "lesson_id": "poem_thirumalai_murugan_pallu", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "matching_pallu_facts", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "பொருத்துக:\n(a) செம்மறையான் - 1. மீன் வகை\n(b) வாடன் சம்பா - 2. மேகம்\n(c) வரால் - 3. மாட்டின் வகை\n(d) கொண்மூ - 4. நெல் வகை", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "(a)-1, (b)-2, (c)-3, (d)-4", "B": "(a)-4, (b)-3, (c)-2, (d)-1", "C": "(a)-3, (b)-4, (c)-1, (d)-2", "D": "(a)-2, (b)-1, (c)-4, (d)-3"}, "explanation": "செம்மறையான் = மாடு (3); வாடன் சம்பா = நெல் (4); வரால் = மீன் (1); கொண்மூ = மேகம் (2). எனவே விடை C."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Match the categories from Thirumalai Murugan Pallu:\n(a) Semmaraiyaan - 1. Fish species\n(b) Vaadan Samba - 2. Cloud\n(c) Varaal - 3. Bullock variety\n(d) Konmoo - 4. Paddy seed variety", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "(a)-1, (b)-2, (c)-3, (d)-4", "B": "(a)-4, (b)-3, (c)-2, (d)-1", "C": "(a)-3, (b)-4, (c)-1, (d)-2", "D": "(a)-2, (b)-1, (c)-4, (d)-3"}, "explanation": "Semmaraiyaan = Bullock; Vaadan Samba = Paddy; Varaal = Fish; Konmoo = Cloud."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corpo