{"id": "11th_tamil_u2_q142", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "11", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_2", "lesson_id": "grammar_punarchi_vithigal", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "nannool_sutra_glides", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "‘இ ஈ ஐ வழி யவ்வும் / ஏனை உயிர் வழி வவ்வும் / ஏமுன் இவ்விருமையும்...’ - இந்நன்னூல் நூற்பா எதனை விளக்குகிறது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "குற்றியலுகரப் புணர்ச்சி", "B": "உடம்படுமெய்ப் புணர்ச்சி விதிகள்", "C": "வேற்றுமைப் புணர்ச்சி", "D": "திசைப் பெயர்ப் புணர்ச்சி"}, "explanation": "இ, ஈ, ஐ ஈறுகளுக்குப் பின் 'ய'கரமும்; ஏனை உயிர்களுக்குப் பின் 'வ'கரமும்; 'ஏ'காரத்திற்குப் பின் 'ய, வ' இரண்டும் உடம்படுமெய்யாக வரும் என்பதை இந்நூற்பா விளக்குகிறது."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "What phonological sandhi rule does the Nannool sutra 'I, Ee, Ai vazhi yavvum / Eanai uyir vazhi vavvum / Ea-mun ivvirumaiyum...' formulate?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Kurriyallukaram elision rules", "B": "Udampadumei glide transition sandhi canons", "C": "Case marker inflection", "D": "Directional noun compounding"}, "explanation": "It defines the exact rules governing glide insertions: 'y' after i/ee/ai, 'v' after other vowels, and both after 'ea'."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "11", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 36, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "11th Tamil, Unit 2, Page 36", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["Class 11", "Unit 2", "Grammar", "Nannool Sutras"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "11th_tamil_u2_q143", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "11", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_2", "lesson_id": "grammar_punarchi_vithigal", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "y_glide_example", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "‘மணி + அடித்தது = மணியடித்தது’ - இதில் இடம்பெற்றுள்ள புணர்ச்சி விதி எது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "ஏனை உயிர் வழி வவ்வும்", "B": "உயிர்வரின் உக்குறள் மெய்விட்டு ஓடும்", "C": "இ ஈ ஐ வழி யவ்வும், உடல்மேல் உயிர்வந்து ஒன்றுவது இயல்பே", "D": "தனிக்குறில் முன் ஒற்று உயிர்வரின் இரட்டும்"}, "explanation": "மணி (ண்+இ) என இகரம் ஈறாக உள்ளதால் 'இ ஈ ஐ வழி யவ்வும்' விதிப்படி 'ய்' தோன்றி, பின் ய்+அ=ய எனப்புணர்ந்து 'மணியடித்தது' என்றானது."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Which grammatical rule governs the sandhi fusion in 'Mani + adiththathu = Maniyadiththathu'?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Eanai uyir vazhi vavvum", "B": "Uyirvarin ukkural meivittu odum", "C": "I Ee Ai vazhi yavvum, followed by Udalmel uyirvanthu ondruvathu iyalbe", "D": "Tanikkuril mun otru uyirvarin irattum"}, "explanation": "Terminating in vowel 'i', it takes glide 'y' via 'I Ee Ai vazhi yavvum' yielding 'Mani-y-adiththathu'."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "11", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 36, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "11th Tamil, Unit 2, Page 36", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["Class 11", "Unit 2", "Grammar", "Y-Glide"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "11th_tamil_u2_q144", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "11", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_2", "lesson_id": "grammar_punarchi_vithigal", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "v_glide_example", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "‘பல + உயிர் = பலவுயிர்’ - இதில் எந்த உடம்படுமெய் தோன்றிப் புணர்ந்துள்ளது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "யகர உடம்படுமெய் (ய்)", "B": "ரகர மெய் (ர்)", "C": "லகர மெய் (ல்)", "D": "வகர உடம்படுமெய் (வ்)"}, "explanation": "பல (ல்+அ): அகரம் ஈறாக உள்ளதால் 'ஏனை உயிர் வழி வவ்வும்' விதிப்படி வகர உடம்படுமெய் (வ்) தோன்றி 'பலவுயிர்' என்றானது."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Which transitional glide appears in the compound 'Pala + uyir = Palavuyir'?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Y-glide (ய்)", "B": "R-consonant (ர்)", "C": "L-consonant (ல்)", "D": "V-glide (வ் via Eanai uyir vazhi vavvum)"}, "explanation": "Terminating in vowel 'a', it takes the V-glide 'v' (வ்) to bridge the hiatus."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "11", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 36, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "11th Tamil, Unit 2, Page 36", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["Class 11", "Unit 2", "Grammar", "V-Glide"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "11th_tamil_u2_q145", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "hard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "11", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_2", "lesson_id": "grammar_punarchi_vithigal", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "both_glides_example", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "‘ஏ’கார ஈற்றுக்கு முன் ‘ய், வ்’ ஆகிய இரு உடம்படுமெய்களும் வருவதற்குச் சிறந்த எடுத்துக்காட்டு எது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "சே + அடி = சேயடி / சேவடி", "B": "தீ + எரிந்தது = தீயெரிந்தது", "C": "பூ + அரும்பு = பூவரும்பு", "D": "கல் + அணை = கல்லணை"}, "explanation": "சே (ச்+ஏ) என்பது ஏகார ஈறு; 'ஏமுன் இவ்விருமையும்' விதிப்படி 'ய்' வரின் சேயடி என்றும், 'வ்' வரின் சேவடி என்றும் இருவடிவிலும் புணரும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Which compound serves as the classic archetype where both 'y' and 'v' glides are legitimately permissible after vowel 'Ea'?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Se + adi = Seyadi / Sevadi (சே + அடி = சேயடி / சேவடி)", "B": "Thee + erinthathu = Theeyerinthathu", "C": "Poo + arumbu = Poovarumbu", "D": "Kal + anai = Kallanai"}, "explanation": "After vowel 'Ea' (சே), both Seyadi (y-glide) and Sevadi (v-glide) are grammatically valid."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "11", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 36, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "11th Tamil, Unit 2, Page 36", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["Class 11", "Unit 2", "Grammar", "Dual Glides"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "11th_tamil_u2_q146", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "11", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_2", "lesson_id": "grammar_punarchi_vithigal", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "kurriyalukaram_rule", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "‘வண்டு + ஆடியது = வண்டாடியது’ - இதில் நிலைமொழி உகரம் கெடுவதற்குரிய விதி எது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "இ ஈ ஐ வழி யவ்வும்", "B": "உயிர்வரின் உக்குறள் மெய்விட்டு ஓடும்", "C": "தனிக்குறில் முன் ஒற்று உயிர்வரின் இரட்டும்", "D": "முற்றியலுகரப் புணர்ச்சி"}, "explanation": "வண்டு (ட்+உ) என்னும் குற்றியலுகரத்தின் முன் 'ஆ' என்னும் உயிர் வந்ததால் 'உயிர்வரின் உக்குறள் மெய்விட்டு ஓடும்' விதிப்படி உகரம் நீங்கி, ட்+ஆ=டா எனப்புணர்ந்தது."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Which rule governs the elision of the terminal 'u' in 'Vandu + aadiyathu = Vandaadiyathu'?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "I Ee Ai vazhi yavvum", "B": "Uyirvarin ukkural meivittu odum (Short 'u' flees leaving consonant when followed by vowel)", "C": "Tanikkuril mun otru uyirvarin irattum", "D": "Mutriyalukaram sandhi"}, "explanation": "'Uyirvarin ukkural meivittu odum' deletes the terminal short 'u' before a following vowel."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "11", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 37, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "11th Tamil, Unit 2, Page 37", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["Class 11", "Unit 2", "Grammar", "Kurriyalukaram Rule"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "11th_tamil_u2_q147", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "11", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_2", "lesson_id": "grammar_punarchi_vithigal", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "tanikkuril_otru_rule", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "‘கண் + அழகு = கண்ணழகு’ - இதில் அமைந்துள்ள புணர்ச்சி விதி யாது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "உயிர்வரின் உக்குறள் மெய்விட்டு ஓடும்", "B": "இ ஈ ஐ வழி யவ்வும்", "C": "தனிக்குறில் முன் ஒற்று உயிர்வரின் இரட்டும், உடல்மேல் உயிர்வந்து ஒன்றுவது இயல்பே", "D": "மகர ஈற்றுப் புணர்ச்சி"}, "explanation": "கண் என்பதில் 'க' தனிக்குறில்; அதன் முன் நின்ற 'ண்' ஒற்று, 'அ' என்னும் உயிர் வர இரட்டித்து (கண்+ண்+அழகு), பின் ண்+அ=ண எனப்புணர்ந்து 'கண்ணழகு' என்றானது."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Which sandhi rule is illustrated by 'Kan + azhagu = Kannazhagu'?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Uyirvarin ukkural meivittu odum", "B": "I Ee Ai vazhi yavvum", "C": "Tanikkuril mun otru uyirvarin irattum (A consonant after an isolated short vowel doubles before a vowel)", "D": "Makara eetru punarchi"}, "explanation": "The isolated short vowel 'ka' causes the succeeding terminal consonant 'n' (ண்) to double before vowel 'a'."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educa