{"id": "11th_tamil_u2_q156", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "hard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "11", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_2", "lesson_id": "grammar_punarchi_vithigal", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "naadu_yaathu", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "‘நாடு + யாது’ என்பதைப் புணர்த்தினால் ‘நாடியாது’ என அமைவதற்குரிய புணர்ச்சி மாற்றம் எது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "உடம்படுமெய்ப் புணர்ச்சி", "B": "தனிக்குறில் ஒற்று இரட்டுதல்", "C": "மகர ஈற்றுப் புணர்ச்சி", "D": "குற்றியலிகரப் புணர்ச்சி (யகரம் வர உகரம் இகரமாதல்)"}, "explanation": "குற்றியலுகர நிலைமொழியின் முன் 'ய'கரம் வரும்போது உகரம் இகரமாகத் திரியும் (நாடு+யாது = நாடியாது). இது குற்றியலிகரம் ஆகும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Which phonological change converts 'Naadu + yaathu' into 'Naadiyaathu'?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Glide insertion", "B": "Consonant doubling", "C": "Makaram deletion", "D": "Kurriyalikaram transformation (Short 'u' mutates into short 'i' before initial 'ya')"}, "explanation": "Before an initial 'y', the preceding Kurriyallukaram transforms into Kurriyalikaram (உ -> இ)."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "11", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 37,