{"id": "11th_tamil_u2_q160", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "11", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_2", "lesson_id": "grammar_punarchi_vithigal", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "mun_azhagu", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "‘முள் + அழகு = முள்ளழகு’ - இப்புணர்ச்சியில் பயன்படும் விதி யாது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "இ ஈ ஐ வழி யவ்வும்", "B": "உயிர்வரின் உக்குறள் மெய்விட்டு ஓடும்", "C": "மகர ஈற்றுப் புணர்ச்சி", "D": "தனிக்குறில் முன் ஒற்று உயிர்வரின் இரட்டும், உடல்மேல் உயிர்வந்து ஒன்றுவது இயல்பே"}, "explanation": "முள் என்பதில் 'மு' தனிக்குறில்; அதன் முன் நின்ற 'ள்' ஒற்று, வருமொழி உயிர் வர இரட்டித்து முள்ளழகு என்றானது."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Which rule governs the compounding of 'Mul + azhagu = Mullazhagu'?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "I Ee Ai vazhi yavvum", "B": "Uyirvarin ukkural meivittu odum", "C": "Makara eetru punarchi", "D": "Tanikkuril mun otru uyirvarin irattum, followed by Udalmel uyirvanthu ondruvathu iyalbe"}, "explanation": "The isolated short vowel 'Mu' causes consonant 'll' (ள்) to double before vowel 'a'."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "11", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 37, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "11th Tamil, Unit 2, Page 37", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["Class 11", "Unit 2", "Grammar", "Consonant Doubling"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "11th_tamil_u2_q161", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "hard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "11", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_2", "lesson_id": "grammar_punarchi_vithigal", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "assertion_reason_sandhi", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "கூற்று (A): தமிழ் மொழியில் இரண்டு உயிரெழுத்துகள் ஒன்றன்பின் ஒன்றாக வரும்போது இடையில் உடம்படுமெய் தோன்றுகிறது.\nகாரணம் (R): தமிழ் இலக்கண மரபில் இரண்டு உயிரெழுத்துகள் இடையில் மெய்யெழுத்தின் துணையின்றி நேரடியாக இணைந்து ஒலிப்பது இயலாது (Hiatus avoidance).", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "கூற்று மற்றும் காரணம் இரண்டும் சரி; காரணம் கூற்றை மிகச்சரியாக விளக்குகிறது", "B": "கூற்று சரி, காரணம் தவறு", "C": "கூற்று தவறு, காரணம் சரி", "D": "கூற்று மற்றும் காரணம் இரண்டும் தவறு"}, "explanation": "தமிழில் உயிர்-உயிர் இடைவெளி (Hiatus) தவிர்க்கப்பட வேண்டும் என்பதற்காகவே உடம்படுமெய் தோன்றுகிறது. எனவே இரண்டும் சரியாகும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Assertion (A): When two vowels clash in Tamil word junctions, an Udampadumei glide emerges between them.\nReason (R): Classical Tamil phonology bars hiatus (vowel clash), mandating a transitional consonant bridge for acoustic harmony.", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Both Assertion and Reason are true; Reason is the correct explanation", "B": "Assertion is true, Reason is false", "C": "Assertion is false, Reason is true", "D": "Both Assertion and Reason are false"}, "explanation": "Both assertion and reason are true as glides prevent acoustic hiatus between vowels."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "11", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 36, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "11th Tamil, Unit 2, Page 36", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["Class 11", "Unit 2", "Grammar", "Assertion-Reason"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "11th_tamil_u2_q162", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "11", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_2", "lesson_id": "grammar_punarchi_vithigal", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "pyq_vavvum_sutra", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "[TNPSC PYQ] ‘ஏனை உயிர் வழி வவ்வும்’ - இதில் ‘ஏனை உயிர்’ என்பவை எவை?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "இ, ஈ, ஐ ஆகிய மூன்று மட்டுமே", "B": "இ, ஈ, ஐ நீங்கலாக எஞ்சிய ஒன்பது உயிரெழுத்துகள் (அ, ஆ, உ, ஊ, எ, ஏ, ஒ, ஓ, ஔ)", "C": "மெய் எழுத்துகள் பதினெட்டு", "D": "ஆய்த எழுத்து மட்டுமே"}, "explanation": "இ, ஈ, ஐ ஆகிய மூன்றைத் தவிர்த்து மீதமுள்ள 9 உயிரெழுத்துகளே 'ஏனை உயிர்' எனப்படுகின்றன; இவற்றின் பின் 'வ்' உடம்படுமெய்யாக வரும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "[TNPSC PYQ] In the sutra 'Eanai uyir vazhi vavvum', which vowels are designated by 'Eanai Uyir' (other vowels)?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "I, Ee, and Ai alone", "B": "The remaining nine vowels excluding I, Ee, and Ai (A, Aa, U, Oo, E, Ea, O, Oa, Au)", "C": "All eighteen consonants", "D": "Aaytham letter only"}, "explanation": "'Eanai uyir' encompasses the 9 vowels outside of I, Ee, and Ai."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "11", "term": "full_yea