{"id": "11th_tamil_u2_q174", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "hard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "11", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_2", "lesson_id": "revision_unit_2", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "match_unit2_authors", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "பொருத்துக:\n(a) கோ. நம்மாழ்வார் - 1. ஒரு சிட்டுக்குருவியின் வீழ்ச்சி\n(b) மசானோபு ஃபுகோகா - 2. அறம் (யானை டாக்டர்)\n(c) அழகிய பெரியவன் - 3. ஒற்றை வைக்கோல் புரட்சி\n(d) ஜெயமோகன் - 4. தகப்பன் கொடி\n(e) டாக்டர் சலீம் அலி - 5. வானகம்", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "(a)-3, (b)-5, (c)-4, (d)-2, (e)-1", "B": "(a)-5, (b)-3, (c)-4, (d)-2, (e)-1", "C": "(a)-5, (b)-4, (c)-3, (d)-1, (e)-2", "D": "(a)-2, (b)-3, (c)-1, (d)-4, (e)-5"}, "explanation": "நம்மாழ்வார் = வானகம் (5); ஃபுகோகா = ஒற்றை வைக்கோல் புரட்சி (3); அழகிய பெரியவன் = தகப்பன் கொடி (4); ஜெயமோகன் = அறம் (2); சலீம் அலி = ஒரு சிட்டுக்குருவியின் வீழ்ச்சி (1). எனவே விடை B."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Match the Unit 2 ecological thinkers with their key institutions/works:\n(a) G. Nammazhvar - 1. The Fall of a Sparrow\n(b) Masanobu Fukuoka - 2. Aram (Yanai Doctor)\n(c) Azhagiya Periyavan - 3. The One-Straw Revolution\n(d) Jeyamohan - 4. Thagappan Kodi\n(e) Dr. Salim Ali - 5. Vaanagam", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "(a)-3, (b)-5, (c)-4, (d)-2, (e)-1", "B": "(a)-5, (b)-3, (c)-4, (d)-2, (e)-1", "C": "(a)-5, (b)-4, (c)-3, (d)-1, (e)-2", "D": "(a)-2, (b)-3, (c)-1, (d)-4, (e)-5"}, "explanation": "Nammazhvar = Vaanagam; Fukuoka = One-Straw Revolution; Periyavan = Thagappan Kodi; Jeyamohan = Aram; Salim Ali = Fall of a Sparrow."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "11", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 35, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "11th Tamil, Unit 2, Page 35", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["Class 11", "Unit 2", "Literature", "Matching"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
