{"id": "11th_tamil_u2_q178", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "hard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "11", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_2", "lesson_id": "revision_unit_2", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "fertilizer_pesticide_terms", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "பொருத்துக:\n(a) Fertilizer - 1. பூச்சிக்கொல்லி\n(b) Pesticide - 2. உரம்\n(c) Mulching - 3. மழைநீர் சேகரிப்பு\n(d) Rainwater Harvesting - 4. மூடாக்கு", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "(a)-1, (b)-2, (c)-3, (d)-4", "B": "(a)-2, (b)-1, (c)-4, (d)-3", "C": "(a)-3, (b)-4, (c)-1, (d)-2", "D": "(a)-4, (b)-3, (c)-2, (d)-1"}, "explanation": "Fertilizer = உரம் (2); Pesticide = பூச்சிக்கொல்லி (1); Mulching = மூடாக்கு (4); Rainwater Harvesting = மழைநீர் சேகரிப்பு (3). எனவே விடை B."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Match the technical agricultural terms with Tamil translations:\n(a) Fertilizer - 1. Poochikkolli\n(b) Pesticide - 2. Uram\n(c) Mulching - 3. Mazhaineer Saegarippu\n(d) Rainwater Harvesting - 4. Moodaakku", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "(a)-1, (b)-2, (c)-3, (d)-4", "B": "(a)-2, (b)-1, (c)-4, (d)-3", "C": "(a)-3, (b)-4, (c)-1, (d)-2", "D": "(a)-4, (b)-3, (c)-2, (d)-1"}, "explanation": "Fertilizer = Uram; Pesticide = Poochikkolli; Mulching = Moodaakku; Rainwater Harvesting = Mazhaineer Saegarippu."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "boo