{"id": "11th_tamil_u2_q179", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "11", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_2", "lesson_id": "revision_unit_2", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "kural_medicine_air", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "‘மருந்தென வேண்டாவாம் யாக்கைக்கு அருந்தியது / அற்றது போற்றி உணின்’ - இக்குறள் உணர்த்தும் நல்வாழ்வு நெறி யாது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "அடிக்கடி மருந்து உண்ண வேண்டும்", "B": "உணவு உண்ணாமல் பட்டினி கிடக்க வேண்டும்", "C": "முன் உண்ட உணவு செரித்ததை (செரிமானம் ஆனதை) அறிந்து அடுத்த வேளை உணவை அளவோடு உண்டால் உடலுக்கு மருந்தே தேவையில்லை", "D": "விலையுயர்ந்த உணவுகளை மட்டுமே உண்ண வேண்டும்"}, "explanation": "முன்பு உண்ட உணவு நன்கு செரித்த பின்னரே அடுத்த வேளை உணவை அளவாக உண்ண வேண்டும்; அவ்வாறு உண்டால் ஒருபோதும் நோயும் மருந்தும் தேவைப்படாது."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "What health wisdom does the Kural 'Marunthena vaendaavaam yaakkaikku arunthiyathu atrathu poatri unin' articulate?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "One must consume pills continuously", "B": "One must starve perpetually", "C": "If one eats with moderation only after previously ingested food is fully digested, the body requires no medicine whatsoever", "D": "Consume exclusively costly gourmet meals"}, "explanation": "Eating moderately after previous meal digestion renders pharmaceutical medicine unnecessary."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "11", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 38, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "11th Tamil, Unit 2, Page 38", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["Class 11", "Unit 2", "Thirukkural", "Health & Medicine"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "11th_tamil_u2_q180", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "hard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "11", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_2", "lesson_id": "revision_unit_2", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "pyq_sandhi_rule_combination", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "[TNPSC PYQ] ‘கலையரசி’ என்னும் சொல் எவ்வாறு உடம்படுமெய் பெற்றுப் புணரும்?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "கலை + வரசி", "B": "கல + அரசி", "C": "கலை + அ + அரசி", "D": "கலை + ய் + அரசி = கலையரசி (இ ஈ ஐ வழி யவ்வும்)"}, "explanation": "கலை (ஐகார ஈறு) + அரசி: 'இ ஈ ஐ வழி யவ்வும்' விதிப்படி 'ய்' உடம்படுமெய் தோன்றி கலையரசி என்றானது."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "[TNPSC PYQ] How does the compound 'Kalaiyarasi' split and fuse according to glide rules?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Kalai + varasi", "B": "Kala + arasi", "C": "Kalai + a + arasi", "D": "Kalai + y + arasi = Kalaiyarasi (via I Ee Ai vazhi yavvum)"}, "explanation": "'Kalai' ends in diphthong 'Ai', inserting Y-glide 'y' before vowel 'a'."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "11", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 36, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "11th Tamil, Unit 2, Page 36", "url": null, "source_notes": null},