{"id": "11th_tamil_u2_q181", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "11", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_2", "lesson_id": "revision_unit_2", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "kural_food_rain", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "‘துப்பார்க்குத் துப்பாய துப்பாக்கித் துப்பார்க்குத் / துப்பாய தூஉம் மழை’ - இக்குறளில் இடம்பெற்றுள்ள ‘துப்பு’ என்னும் சொல் தரும் மூன்று பொருள்கள் எவை?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "உண்பவர், உணவு, நல்ல நன்மை (சுவை)", "B": "துப்பாக்கி, தோட்டா, வீரன்", "C": "தூய்மை, வெண்மை, வெளிச்சம்", "D": "மண், காற்று, நெருப்பு"}, "explanation": "இக்குறளில் துப்பு என்பது உண்பவர்க்கு (துப்பார்க்கு), உணவாகி (துப்பாய), நன்மையையும் உணவையும் தரும் (தூஉம்) மழையைக் குறிக்கிறது."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "What three meanings does the polysemic word 'Thuppu' signify across the verse 'Thuppaarkkuth thuppaaya thuppaakkith thuppaarkkuth thuppaaya thoouum mazhai'?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Eater / consumer, wholesome food, and life-giving nourishment / benefit", "B": "Gun, bullet, and soldier", "C": "Purity, whiteness, and illumination", "D": "Soil, air, and fire"}, "explanation": "'Thuppu' poetically signifies the consumer, the food created, and the beneficial sustenance bestowed by rain."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "11", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 38, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "11th Tamil, Unit 2, Page 38", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["Class 11", "Unit 2", "Thirukkural", "Word Polysemy"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "11th_tamil_u2_q182", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "11", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_2", "lesson_id": "revision_unit_2", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "pyq_jeyamohan_story", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "[TNPSC PYQ] காடுகளையும் காட்டு யானைகளையும் காப்பாற்ற தன் வாழ்நாளை அர்ப்பணித்த டாக்டர் கே-வின் கதையை ‘யானை டாக்டர்’ என்ற தலைப்பில் எழுதியவர் யார்?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "சுந்தர ராமசாமி", "B": "ஜெயமோகன்", "C": "அழகிய பெரியவன்", "D": "இந்திரன்"}, "explanation": "ஜெயமோகன் 'அறம்' சிறுகதைத் தொகுப்பில் யானை டாக்டர் கதையை எழுதினார்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "[TNPSC PYQ] Who authored the story 'Yanai Doctor' celebrating Dr. K's heroic veterinary service to wild elephants?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Sundara Ramaswamy", "B": "Jeyamohan", "C": "Azhagiya Periyavan", "D": "Indiran"}, "explanation": "Jeyamohan authored 'Yanai Doctor' in his collection 'Aram'."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "11", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 31, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "11th Tamil, Unit 2, Page 31", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previo