{"id": "11th_tamil_u2_q185", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "hard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "11", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_2", "lesson_id": "revision_unit_2", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "statement_verification_paddy", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "பாரம்பரிய நெல் ரகங்கள் பற்றிய கீழ்க்கண்ட கூற்றுகளை ஆராய்க:\n1. மாப்பிள்ளைச் சம்பா நரம்பு வலிமையையும் உடல் பலத்தையும் தருகிறது.\n2. காட்டுயாணம் வறட்சியைத் தாங்கி 7 அடி வரை உயரமாக வளரக்கூடியது.\n3. சீரகச் சம்பா மருத்துவக் குணமும் நறுமணமும் கொண்ட பிரியாணி நெல் ரகமாகும்.\nஇவற்றுள் சரியான கூற்றுகள் எவை?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "1, 2, 3 ஆகிய மூன்றும் சரி", "B": "1 மற்றும் 2 மட்டுமே சரி", "C": "2 மற்றும் 3 மட்டுமே சரி", "D": "1 மட்டுமே சரி"}, "explanation": "கூற்றுகள் 1, 2, 3 ஆகிய மூன்றும் பாரம்பரிய நெல் ரகங்களின் உண்மைப் பண்புகளைச் சரியாக விவரிக்கின்றன."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Evaluate the following statements regarding indigenous heritage rice varieties:\n1. Mappillai Samba provides remarkable muscular and nervous stamina.\n2. Kaattuyanam grows up to 7 feet tall and resists severe drought.\n3. Seeraga Samba is a medicinal, aromatic fine rice prized for festive dishes.\nWhich are correct?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "All 1, 2, and 3 are correct", "B": "1 and 2 only are correct", "C": "2 and 3 only are correct", "D": "1 only is correct"}, "explanation": "All three statements accurately define the agronomic traits of native heritage rice varieties."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "11", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 26, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "11th Tamil, Unit 2, Page 26", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["Class 11", "Unit 2", "Agronomy", "Statement Analysis"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
